0,ISO 639:a - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_639:a,This is a list of ISO 639-3 language codes starting with A.,Ipulo,Niger-Congo
1,Ipulo | Ethnologue Free,https://www.ethnologue.com/language/ass/?cf=1&token=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.._BZRKwek69UtnV7EAL3fo5MHd7R2WUJH8Yu581xyonw,Ipulo is a stable indigenous language of Cameroon. It belongs to the Niger-Congo language family. The language is used as a first language by all in the ethnic community.,Ipulo,Niger-Congo
2,Ipulo | Accent Network,https://accentnetwork.com/ipulo/,"Ipulo is a language spoken by the Ass people. It belongs to the Niger-Congo family. Predominantly spoken in Nigeria, with a small number of native speakers.",Ipulo,Niger-Congo
