9,Eman language — Grokipedia,https://grokipedia.com/page/eman_language,"Eman speakers commonly use Ipulo as a second language, leading to lexical borrowing in domains like kinship and daily activities, while regional proximity to Grassfields languages has introduced Bantoid-rooted terms into Eman's vocabulary.",Ipulo,Niger-Congo
